    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Legendary</em></p><p>This tube holds milky liquid with a strong alcohol smell. When found, a tube contains 1d6 + 1 ounces.</p><p>You can take a Utilize action to pour 1 or more ounces of solvent from the tube onto a surface within reach. Each ounce instantly dissolves up to 1 square foot of adhesive it touches, including @UUID[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.equipment.Item.dmgSovereignGlue]{Sovereign Glue}.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-cCr2F0ctb7qvQ3x8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This item includes 7 limited uses. The <strong>Determine Ounces</strong> activity can be used to determine the number of ounces equivalent to 1d6 + 1.</p><p>The <strong>Apply Solvent</strong> activity allows you to select the number of ounces you're applying.</p></section>",
